completion no template: study: model.endpoint = "completion" requires model.prompt_template containing the "{prompt}" placeholder (the study-declared instruct wrapper)
completion with template: ok
chat endpoint: ok
bad endpoint: study: unknown model.endpoint "smoke-signals" (want "chat" or "completion")
no conditions: study: definition lists no conditions
zero runs: study: runs_per_cell must be >= 1, got 0
direction only: study: a control study must declare both direction and baseline_regime, or neither (got direction="lift", baseline_regime="")
no temperature: study: sampling.temperature must be declared explicitly (0.0 for deterministic decoding) — an unrecorded temperature is unreproducible
